schema SitePresentation
generation site-presentation-1
authority CMS + SurfaceIR + AddressPlane + InformationPolicy

field site_id
  type text
  required true
  role stable-site-identity

field host
  type text
  required true
  role addressed-host

field subject_address
  type text
  required true
  role semantic-subject-reference

field profile
  type text
  required true
  role observed-ghost-profile-reference

field territory
  type enum
  values life live shop work
  required true

field navigation
  type json
  required true
  role presentation-navigation-only

field status
  type enum
  values draft published retired
  required true

invariant profile-is-presentation-only
  statement changing profile changes only visual composition and slot geometry; it never changes host identity, subject truth, source admission, rights, authority or effects

invariant host-is-addressed
  statement host resolves through AddressPlane and cannot be selected from browser state or a caller-provided actor coordinate

forbidden_inference SitePresentation profile -> Ghost code, donor backend, source admission, material truth, audience entitlement or authority
forbidden_inference SitePresentation host -> ownership of every subject or source shown there

schema SemanticSlot
generation site-presentation-1
authority CMS + SurfaceIR

field slot_id
  type text
  required true
  role stable-slot-identity

field site_id
  type text
  required true
  role parent-site-reference

field slot_name
  type enum
  values hero lead feature secondary ticker rail gallery body sidebar footer_feature
  required true

field ordinal
  type u64
  required true

field extent
  type enum
  values chip card section page workspace immersive
  required true

field accepts
  type set[text]
  required true
  role typed-material-or-application-acceptance

field min_material_quality
  type enum
  values any standard high
  required true

field max_items
  type u64
  required true

field htmx_boundary
  type text
  role native-fragment-boundary

field status
  type enum
  values draft published retired
  required true

invariant slot-never-names-a-source
  statement a slot accepts typed material or an application, not raw external source IDs, protocol names or execution chains

invariant slot-is-not-an-owner
  statement a slot chooses extent and placement only; it cannot grant disclosure, authority, spend, effect or provider admission

forbidden_inference SemanticSlot accepts Article -> an Article exists or is lawful to publish
forbidden_inference SemanticSlot accepts Watch -> a video or media right exists

schema SourceCollection
generation site-presentation-1
authority CMS + PackGraph + ForeignTwin

field collection_id
  type text
  required true
  role stable-editorial-reagent-group

field subject_address
  type text
  required true
  role scoped-world-or-topic

field source_selector
  type json
  required true
  role observed-source-selection-only

field material_kind
  type set[text]
  required true
  role typed-material-output

field refresh_policy
  type text
  required true
  role ResourceWeather-demand-reference

field status
  type enum
  values draft published retired
  required true

invariant collection-is-not-content
  statement a collection groups observed source candidates for a typed material compiler; it is not itself a public feed, post, event or provider

forbidden_inference SourceCollection selector -> source freshness, rights, body retention, publication permission or material truth

schema ApplicationBinding
generation site-presentation-1
authority CMS + SurfaceIR + InformationPolicy

field binding_id
  type text
  required true
  role stable-composition-identity

field site_id
  type text
  required true

field slot_id
  type text
  required true

field application_kind
  type enum
  values PublicationFeed Newsroom Article Gallery Watch Listen Podcast Thread Community Board LiveEvent Calendar Scoreboard Standings Ticker MarketTape QuoteBook Product Marketplace Checkout Ticketing Map Route Property HousingSearch Restaurant Reservation Ride Shipment Tracking Weather Incident Alert ResearchPaper Dataset Experiment Repository IssueTracker BuildStatus Documentation SupportCase ServiceRequest Grant FundingOpportunity Job Applicant Course Lesson Quiz ProviderDirectory Appointment Policy Claim Portfolio Asset Vehicle Maintenance Facility UtilityStatus
  required true

field material_query
  type json
  required true
  role typed-owner-query

field source_collection
  type text
  role optional-reagent-input

field action_aperture
  type text
  role native-effect-reference

field continuity_key
  type text
  role playback-or-interaction-continuity-reference

field status
  type enum
  values draft published retired
  required true

invariant application-is-not-a-source-renderer
  statement application_kind defines interaction physics over typed material; raw source names, protocol labels and chain labels are never human application names

invariant effect-remains-native
  statement an action_aperture names a native owner gate and cannot itself authorize a mutation, payment, booking, publication or spend

forbidden_inference ApplicationBinding action_aperture -> actor authority, payment authority, provider admission or completed effect
forbidden_inference ApplicationBinding source_collection -> a source record is content

schema CapabilityProgram
generation site-presentation-1
authority CapabilityClosure + AuthorityGraph + CommitmentGraph + EvidenceGraph

field program_id
  type text
  required true
  role executable-capability-identity

field application_kind
  type text
  required true

field action
  type text
  required true

field consumes
  type set[text]
  required true

field produces
  type set[text]
  required true

field carrier_candidates
  type set[text]
  required true

field capability_requirements
  type set[text]
  required true

field authority_requirement
  type text
  required true

field transition_conditions
  type json
  required true

field failure_projection
  type text
  required true

field status
  type enum
  values draft published retired
  required true

invariant carrier-is-subprogram
  statement MCP, Beckn, x402, OpenAPI and other carriers are selected only beneath a typed human action; none is an application identity or visible catalogue item

invariant capability-does-not-commit
  statement a resolved capability is an eligible execution phenotype and never a completed purchase, booking, payment, publication or transfer

forbidden_inference CapabilityProgram carrier_candidates -> runnable provider, price, credential, authority, spend approval or settlement

